d" class="r-fr4cvf"><div data-rid="7c354021-d83e-4f19-8d14-d7b3d4612ce8" class="r-m7228x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Starts conversations</span></div></div><div data-rid="da04f76a-7dda-4fe8-a012-990e1d64d4b6" class="r-fmjmrc"><div data-rid="fb77432e-9b18-437e-82b8-841b3941f699" class="r-yl7xpy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The design choices are specific: alligator, eagle, tiger, lion, kraken, mermaid, dragon, and pelican. Nothing generic.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7b126201-31be-4c36-8393-03b3ef11445e" class="r-1unw6zs"><div data-rid="c7e53eda-6184-493c-a118-9e5b4cdb8fc2" class="r-uveo6b"><div data-rid="2d8c3db0-4517-437d-8759-04bb632329b1" class="r-9dn0f4"><div data-rid="242a1c42-0b3c-4197-9778-b6a889b88bc6" class="r-nk9pz0"><div data-rid="ebfbb0f3-2a33-4fda-a820-bafceccedebf" class="r-1cd86hu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Celebrity-level detail</span></div></div><div data-rid="9e14b6b5-134b-4a58-ac05-1c0cb463c4aa" class="r-rnql9y"><div data-rid="7840e8c8-2a73-4d3f-a7e5-ac02febb0d78" class="r-gzr3jm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For red carpets, formal nights, and men who know the jacket is never just a jacket.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c7bf11cf-a670-4d54-a863-108c4a82004c" class="r-vat8of"><div data-rid="a8f7bf99-242a-45d8-b658-ccb481f14090" class="r-1ncvn1b"><div data-rid="72772ca2-a139-4c3e-9086-327572edc252" class="r-1v3xay4"><div data-rid="f5684105-8970-4e21-b0c3-9e064ca19c96" class="r-qpmxtk"><div data-rid="266cb2e7-43dd-4e9f-a5f9-d9624a1e3b93" class="r-gx7voi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">The product detail lab</span></div></div><div data-rid="e73d549b-702c-44cd-a1c5-26f4d5a32b55" class="r-tsjhad"><div data-rid="d5b7b55d-123a-4fe6-8f8c-80295227c51a" class="r-1wbp7w2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">This does<br>what fabric<br>cannot.</span></div></div><div data-rid="52401e33-eb46-424f-951d-0a6d74fe0b2d" class="r-114ngym"><div data-rid="ad5b2112-7e79-4096-b5ca-352d83563656" class="r-kds8op alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">A traditional pocket square can fold, collapse, puff<br>unevenly, and disappear into the pocket. The Pocket<br>Square™ is engineered as jewelry: sculpted, weighted,<br>polished, and held upright by its magnetic insert.</span></div></div><div data-rid="80c20015-e44b-49c4-859c-8285f4db621f" class="r-76089x"><div data-rid="9eb9fd76-fed6-453c-a506-42ff2b81ba59" class="r-1qhqgcy"><div data-rid="8286e954-c937-4f30-84cb-c9c74a498938" class="r-15kceuz"><div data-rid="6eacd71d-7c28-4ea4-80d5-bd226f1338c9" class="r-yc05jy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">01</span></div></div><div data-rid="fa7cacc4-86e5-47a8-8391-4b96fa7d3c8e" class="r-q1tjf1"><div data-rid="63c4d59a-131f-4f8d-9bd4-0e1573852cc7" class="r-dv6t2d"><div data-rid="cc1d942a-76db-49ec-a450-9ecdce071cd0" class="r-1onrd2h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Stays upright</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="d0dd965a-0261-4b79-bfc0-e2f519d36326" class="r-1p0md25"><div data-rid="bc7c1157-a2dc-4a4e-abc3-7ec69dd883a5" class="r-mzskve alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The sculpture is made to hold its shape, so the jacket<br>pocket keeps a clean statement all night.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e63d0456-7173-4115-b1ca-13ff60c6d5a1" class="r-fbub2h"><div data-rid="870b3725-63c7-41f8-84dc-357e5941e703" class="r-j8t8n8"><div data-rid="86709a15-233d-4c84-a1c5-d8abd631484b" class="r-6ndtwg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">02</span></div></div><div data-rid="6bb74fd1-5982-4a06-912c-47f63fbe9eb4" class="r-4o444a"><div data-rid="80a1b25e-14e1-42c1-af47-6b0b0be74d5a" class="r-kwhxxn"><div data-rid="704e1c6d-f9e5-42d9-b209-88179f14ac9b" class="r-a0eqgr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Secures with a patented insert</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="110f45f8-ae36-4068-a96c-61172702add0" class="r-16l5iw9"><div data-rid="7c240067-58d6-42b1-80b8-62e07401f3e3" class="r-il4mqd alchemy-rte">